WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.020
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 8)

4
01:05.480 --> 01:07.279
I haven't been back for a while.

5
01:07.359 --> 01:08.680
The house is lively again.

6
01:09.519 --> 01:11.279
Why didn't you tell me you were coming back?

7
01:11.959 --> 01:13.640
I wanted to surprise you.

8
01:14.359 --> 01:16.319
Instead, you ended up giving me a huge surprise.

9
01:19.480 --> 01:21.159
With so many people in the house,

10
01:21.239 --> 01:22.840
which one is your new favorite?

11
01:25.120 --> 01:27.560
A Pong and Milan will be joining my company soon.

12
01:28.200 --> 01:30.040
They'll be making money for you in the future.

13
01:31.560 --> 01:33.040
So the one you slept with

14
01:33.120 --> 01:35.439
is the boy you carried home last time?

15
01:35.519 --> 01:36.896
Didn't you hear everything just now?

16
01:36.920 --> 01:37.920
Why bother asking?

17
01:39.599 --> 01:40.879
Well, you're young.

18
01:40.959 --> 01:44.000
It's normal to have desires and let off some steam occasionally.

19
01:44.920 --> 01:46.279
However, I heard

20
01:46.359 --> 01:48.319
you haven't been going to the office much lately.

21
01:49.439 --> 01:51.799
Did you check last quarter's financial report?

22
01:51.879 --> 01:54.280
Haven't you been neglecting the company for a while?

23
01:55.680 --> 01:57.736
And what about that in-house variety show you mentioned?

24
01:57.760 --> 01:59.160
Why hasn't there been any progress?

25
02:00.719 --> 02:03.560
Milan is the one I picked to be the guest on the show.

26
02:04.560 --> 02:06.415
Even though he's in a dispute to terminate his contract,

27
02:06.439 --> 02:07.439
to be honest,

28
02:08.319 --> 02:10.559
plenty of agencies in Tailan want to work with him.

29
02:10.639 --> 02:13.040
To win him over, you have to win over the people around him

30
02:13.120 --> 02:14.240
and bring his team on board.

31
02:14.919 --> 02:16.320
If he agrees to join us,

32
02:16.400 --> 02:18.320
our show won't have to worry about getting buzz.

33
02:19.080 --> 02:20.080
Good.

34
02:20.159 --> 02:21.520
You didn't let me down after all.

35
02:22.560 --> 02:25.320
So, can you lock Milan down?

36
02:25.400 --> 02:26.639
Can we sign him smoothly?

37
02:27.159 --> 02:28.159
No problem.

38
02:31.120 --> 02:32.239
Well,

39
02:32.319 --> 02:33.319
that's good.

40
02:35.560 --> 02:37.440
Since you can sign him,

41
02:37.520 --> 02:39.200
keep your hands off the people around him.

42
02:39.639 --> 02:41.000
Those boys of yours,

43
02:41.080 --> 02:42.240
give it a rest.

44
02:46.680 --> 02:48.360
What's that weird smell on you?

45
02:49.800 --> 02:51.639
People of our status

46
02:51.719 --> 02:53.519
must smell fresh at all times.

47
02:53.599 --> 02:56.240
It probably got on me while I was making breakfast.

48
02:57.680 --> 02:59.519
You didn't just make breakfast,

49
02:59.599 --> 03:00.960
you even ate with them?

50
03:01.919 --> 03:03.920
I came today to remind you

51
03:04.000 --> 03:05.360
that this is the last time.

52
03:05.960 --> 03:09.159
Stop bringing random strangers into the house from now on.

53
03:09.879 --> 03:11.520
They leave the stench of poverty behind.

54
03:22.439 --> 03:23.679
See?

55
03:23.759 --> 03:25.479
This is the scent that suits you.

56
03:27.919 --> 03:28.919
To me,

57
03:31.039 --> 03:32.039
he's not a stranger.

58
03:34.759 --> 03:36.840
So you're dead set on dating him?

59
03:37.840 --> 03:40.479
Just like that last one.

60
03:42.680 --> 03:43.680
What was his name again?

61
03:45.800 --> 03:46.800
Taozi?

62
03:47.639 --> 03:48.639
Yes.

63
03:49.159 --> 03:50.280
But please call him Pao Bei.

64
03:51.360 --> 03:52.680
He's not that person from before.

65
03:53.159 --> 03:54.919
Please don't bring up irrelevant people.

66
03:56.120 --> 03:57.360
What's the difference?

67
03:58.560 --> 04:00.679
Even if their backgrounds are different,

68
04:00.759 --> 04:01.759
it will end the same way.

69
04:03.319 --> 04:05.440
Don't tell me you've forgotten about the agreement

70
04:05.520 --> 04:07.320
you signed when Father passed away.

71
04:07.400 --> 04:08.840
It's legally binding.

72
04:09.919 --> 04:11.679
If you insist on being with him...

73
04:11.759 --> 04:12.759
Don't worry.

74
04:13.319 --> 04:14.959
I won't let it get in the way of my work.

75
04:15.719 --> 04:17.016
Whether I'm just fooling around with him

76
04:17.040 --> 04:18.400
or in it for the long haul,

77
04:18.480 --> 04:19.480
it's my business.

78
04:21.000 --> 04:22.000
Besides,

79
04:22.560 --> 04:25.040
I don't really care about that agreement.

80
04:25.920 --> 04:28.639
Right now, I just want to follow my heart.

81
04:30.199 --> 04:32.040
If I really breach the contract one day

82
04:33.399 --> 04:34.920
and you want to take away my assets,

83
04:35.000 --> 04:36.000
go right ahead.

84
04:38.360 --> 04:39.480
That'll just be my fate.

85
04:47.519 --> 04:48.640
What is it?

86
04:48.720 --> 04:50.879
Mr. Pao Bei has changed back into his own clothes

87
04:50.959 --> 04:53.119
and left with Mr. A Pong.

88
04:53.199 --> 04:55.319
They saw you were busy and didn't want to bother you,

89
04:55.360 --> 04:56.680
so they asked me to let you know.

90
04:57.480 --> 05:00.879
Also, regarding the meeting on Mr. Milan's contract,

91
05:00.959 --> 05:03.160
the legal team would like to meet with you privately.

92
05:03.680 --> 05:05.360
Tell Legal to wait for me at the office.

93
05:06.839 --> 05:09.279
And the meeting with the show's director today,

94
05:09.839 --> 05:11.456
that's scheduled at the office too, right?

95
05:11.480 --> 05:12.319
Yes, Young Master.

96
05:12.399 --> 05:13.399
Okay.

97
05:18.120 --> 05:19.359
You see,

98
05:19.439 --> 05:20.679
I still have a lot on my plate.

99
05:21.279 --> 05:22.400
So, brother,

100
05:22.480 --> 05:24.640
I won't be staying home to have a meal with you today.

101
05:25.639 --> 05:27.279
Oh, and one more thing.

102
05:28.279 --> 05:30.720
Give me a heads-up before you come back next time.

103
05:30.800 --> 05:34.120
In case it turns out to be a shock instead of a surprise,

104
05:34.759 --> 05:37.720
for someone like you who prefers a quiet life,

105
05:37.800 --> 05:39.080
it would be torture,

106
05:39.160 --> 05:40.160
wouldn't it?

107
05:54.600 --> 05:55.879
This is your scent.

108
05:55.959 --> 05:56.959
I'm not a fan of it.

109
06:06.480 --> 06:09.160
Is this scent a bit too strong?

110
06:10.600 --> 06:11.759
Can I be honest?

111
06:12.560 --> 06:13.879
Go ahead.

112
06:13.959 --> 06:15.519
It doesn't really suit your vibe.

113
06:16.480 --> 06:17.480
What's my vibe?

114
06:18.600 --> 06:20.839
Actually, you come across as quite warm,

115
06:21.480 --> 06:23.040
but this scent is way too cold.

116
06:25.160 --> 06:27.640
That's the first time anyone has called me warm.

117
06:27.720 --> 06:29.440
People usually say I'm pretty intimidating.

118
06:30.680 --> 06:33.199
Well, the way you lost your temper and yelled earlier,

119
06:34.079 --> 06:36.680
that was indeed a bit scary.

120
06:41.800 --> 06:43.320
The two of us were just joking around.

121
06:43.360 --> 06:44.640
Who the hell is joking with you?

122
06:44.959 --> 06:46.159
Are you messing with me again?

123
06:47.279 --> 06:49.439
Did I really scare him?

124
06:51.040 --> 06:53.720
Honestly, you scared me too.

125
06:55.600 --> 06:56.879
Was it really that bad?

126
06:58.439 --> 06:59.679
It wasn't that bad, was it?

127
06:59.759 --> 07:01.560
I'm not talking about your attitude.

128
07:02.240 --> 07:03.959
I mean what you said earlier

129
07:05.480 --> 07:07.040
about the two of you sleeping together.

130
07:07.319 --> 07:08.480
That can't be true, right?

131
07:10.160 --> 07:11.495
You guys were just putting on an act.

132
07:11.519 --> 07:12.720
It was a joke, right?

133
07:17.079 --> 07:18.239
You really did sleep together...?

134
07:23.399 --> 07:24.759
What's wrong?

135
07:24.839 --> 07:27.439
Do you think Pao Bei wouldn't like someone like me?

136
07:27.519 --> 07:28.519
Of course not.

137
07:29.240 --> 07:30.600
For someone as outstanding as you,

138
07:30.639 --> 07:32.920
it's only natural for people to like you.

139
07:33.600 --> 07:34.639
It's just that...

140
07:36.066 --> 07:37.066
"It's just that..."?

141
07:37.920 --> 07:40.720
Or do you think I wouldn't like Pao Bei?

142
07:43.519 --> 07:44.519
Not that either.

143
07:45.199 --> 07:46.240
Pao Bei is adorable.

144
07:47.560 --> 07:48.560
I like him a lot too.

145
07:50.480 --> 07:51.560
What do you like about him?

146
07:52.839 --> 07:53.920
He's kind,

147
07:55.519 --> 07:56.519
hardworking,

148
07:57.680 --> 07:58.680
and very simple.

149
08:00.040 --> 08:01.079
Just like...

150
08:03.519 --> 08:05.199
Just like the grass on the ground.

151
08:05.279 --> 08:07.399
No matter how barren the environment is,

152
08:07.920 --> 08:09.360
as long as there's a ray of sunshine

153
08:10.040 --> 08:11.279
and a drop of rain,

154
08:11.879 --> 08:13.359
it will seize the chance

155
08:13.439 --> 08:14.759
and grow tenaciously.

156
08:16.040 --> 08:17.560
It doesn't ask for much,

157
08:18.120 --> 08:21.120
yet it always gives life back to the world.

158
08:23.600 --> 08:25.240
Since you and I are so in sync,

159
08:26.120 --> 08:27.519
you must feel the same way, right?

160
08:31.160 --> 08:33.000
I fully support the two of you being together,

161
08:33.799 --> 08:36.879
and I think Pao Bei really likes you too.

162
08:39.039 --> 08:40.319
As an outsider,

163
08:40.399 --> 08:41.759
I can see it very clearly.

164
08:48.120 --> 08:49.160
Well...

165
08:49.240 --> 08:50.279
It's just a pity that

166
08:51.960 --> 08:53.840
every time it feels like we're making progress,

167
08:56.480 --> 08:58.399
we end up having a fight like the one just now.

168
09:03.039 --> 09:04.039
Are the two of us

169
09:06.919 --> 09:08.599
just not right for each other?

170
09:08.679 --> 09:10.519
No two people are born a perfect match.

171
09:13.279 --> 09:14.639
If you want it to last,

172
09:16.360 --> 09:18.360
you have to learn to be considerate of each other.

173
09:20.799 --> 09:21.960
I feel like

174
09:22.840 --> 09:24.800
he doesn't plan on going that far with me anyway.

175
09:25.559 --> 09:26.319
If I were him,

176
09:26.399 --> 09:28.559
I wouldn't dare hope to go too far with you either.

177
09:28.639 --> 09:31.000
After all, you're so high and mighty.

178
09:31.080 --> 09:32.216
In his eyes, he must feel like

179
09:32.240 --> 09:34.160
he's from a completely different world than you.

180
09:34.799 --> 09:35.719
Of course,

181
09:35.799 --> 09:37.679
that's just how I see it.

182
09:37.759 --> 09:39.520
I think you could try talking to him

183
09:39.600 --> 09:41.240
patiently and gently,

184
09:41.759 --> 09:43.159
just like how you're talking to me,

185
09:43.919 --> 09:45.440
and hear what he truly thinks.

186
09:46.519 --> 09:48.160
He already left with A Pong

187
09:48.240 --> 09:49.519
without even saying goodbye.

188
09:50.320 --> 09:51.600
Where am I supposed to find him?

189
09:52.320 --> 09:54.159
When you really want to see someone,

190
09:54.840 --> 09:56.120
you'll always find a way.

191
10:00.200 --> 10:01.200
By the way,

192
10:01.879 --> 10:03.519
when they were leaving earlier,

193
10:04.039 --> 10:06.079
A Pong mentioned Pao Bei's scooter is a bit old

194
10:06.159 --> 10:07.360
and hard to ride.

195
10:07.879 --> 10:09.960
I wonder if they made it home safely.

196
10:13.840 --> 10:14.959
Young Master,

197
10:15.039 --> 10:16.160
it's almost time.

198
10:16.240 --> 10:17.040
We should head out.

199
10:17.120 --> 10:18.120
Okay.

200
10:19.480 --> 10:21.480
I need you to do something for me later.

201
10:22.440 --> 10:23.000
Yes, Young Master.

202
10:23.080 --> 10:24.080
I'll take care of it.

203
10:36.600 --> 10:37.720
Why are you staring at me?

204
10:40.960 --> 10:41.880
Tell me.

205
10:41.960 --> 10:44.040
I thought I knew you pretty well.

206
10:44.120 --> 10:45.440
But now I realize.

207
10:46.039 --> 10:47.480
I barely recognize you anymore.

208
10:49.519 --> 10:50.600
What makes you say that?

209
10:52.559 --> 10:53.719
Be honest with me.

210
10:53.799 --> 10:56.360
Did that guy use your debt

211
10:56.440 --> 10:57.720
to force you into bed with him?

212
11:00.279 --> 11:01.279
Of course not.

213
11:01.879 --> 11:03.239
Like I'd ever let anyone force me.

214
11:04.720 --> 11:05.520
Pao Bei,

215
11:05.600 --> 11:07.559
you're really playing the long game here.

216
11:07.639 --> 11:09.240
First, you win him over.

217
11:09.320 --> 11:10.879
Make him fall head over heels for you.

218
11:11.440 --> 11:13.519
Then, once you've had your fun, you dump him hard.

219
11:14.279 --> 11:15.976
Last time he treated us to the amusement park.

220
11:16.000 --> 11:17.479
Where are we going next?

221
11:17.559 --> 11:18.799
How about a trip abroad?

222
11:28.799 --> 11:29.919
Wait, what's with that look?

223
11:30.399 --> 11:32.199
Don't tell me it's over after just one night.

224
11:32.720 --> 11:34.320
Are you tired of him already?

225
11:35.240 --> 11:39.000
Actually, I'm seriously considering dating him.

226
11:41.480 --> 11:42.799
What?

227
11:42.879 --> 11:44.080
You actually like him?

228
11:46.720 --> 11:48.120
Hold on.

229
11:48.200 --> 11:51.440
How can you put up with a guy like that long-term?

230
11:53.399 --> 11:55.559
I have my ways of handling him.

231
11:56.600 --> 11:57.759
Like what?

232
12:01.159 --> 12:02.760
Why is this tiny thing so spicy?

233
12:02.840 --> 12:03.840
Water!

234
12:06.000 --> 12:08.240
Don't drink water, it'll only make it worse.

235
12:08.879 --> 12:10.160
Chilies have capsaicin in them.

236
12:10.240 --> 12:11.559
If you drink water,

237
12:11.639 --> 12:13.719
it just spreads the burn faster.

238
12:13.799 --> 12:15.440
It'll only make your mouth burn more.

239
12:16.639 --> 12:17.839
Milk.

240
12:17.919 --> 12:19.039
Here, drink this instead.

241
12:24.039 --> 12:25.480
Milk contains fat.

242
12:26.039 --> 12:28.000
The fat binds to the capsaicin

243
12:28.080 --> 12:29.360
and dissolves it right away.

244
12:29.440 --> 12:30.280
That stops the burning.

245
12:30.360 --> 12:31.639
Yeah, I know that.

246
12:32.440 --> 12:35.320
Why are you lecturing me like a science teacher?

247
12:36.919 --> 12:38.360
Didn't you just ask how I'm going

248
12:39.679 --> 12:40.720
to handle him?

249
12:41.639 --> 12:42.919
If he's the chili pepper,

250
12:43.679 --> 12:44.720
and I'm the water,

251
12:45.840 --> 12:47.039
it'll only backfire.

252
12:48.000 --> 12:50.120
But if I'm the milk,

253
12:50.639 --> 12:52.759
I can neutralize his heat completely.

254
12:53.960 --> 12:56.399
I only half-get what you're saying,

255
12:57.440 --> 12:58.719
but it sounds pretty badass.

256
12:58.799 --> 13:00.159
I'm sticking with you from now on.

257
13:00.960 --> 13:02.880
When you move into a big mansion,

258
13:02.960 --> 13:04.840
don't forget your buddy A Pong.

259
13:07.440 --> 13:08.839
A Pong,

260
13:08.919 --> 13:10.040
look who's talking.

261
13:10.120 --> 13:12.360
Aren't you working for a big movie star now?

262
13:13.080 --> 13:14.839
Neither of us should be freeloaders.

263
13:14.919 --> 13:17.640
Once you make it big in showbiz,

264
13:17.720 --> 13:19.120
you can make me a star, too.

265
13:19.200 --> 13:21.599
My gig is nowhere near as solid as yours.

266
13:21.679 --> 13:23.679
You're practically marrying into a dynasty.

267
13:26.600 --> 13:27.919
If that's how you see it,

268
13:28.559 --> 13:29.976
you could always marry into his family, too.

269
13:30.000 --> 13:32.759
I think you and Milan make a pretty good match.

270
13:34.279 --> 13:35.599
What are you talking about?

271
13:35.679 --> 13:36.759
Quit talking nonsense.

272
13:38.799 --> 13:41.160
Why aren't Xiaotong and Xiaoya back yet?

273
13:41.240 --> 13:42.600
I'll go check on them.

274
13:53.840 --> 13:54.840
We're here, Master.

275
14:08.840 --> 14:09.840
Coming!

276
14:11.120 --> 14:12.480
The Young Master wants to see you.

277
14:14.799 --> 14:15.879
Why'd you call me out here?

278
14:16.879 --> 14:18.040
Teach me how to ride this.

279
14:18.120 --> 14:19.479
Don't you know how?

280
14:19.559 --> 14:20.920
Then how did you get it here?

281
14:21.000 --> 14:22.280
You just can't go a single day

282
14:22.360 --> 14:23.680
without messing with me, can you?

283
14:24.200 --> 14:25.640
Mingkun gave me a ride.

284
14:25.720 --> 14:26.599
If you teach me how to ride it,

285
14:26.679 --> 14:27.520
I'll give it to you.

286
14:27.600 --> 14:28.679
It's brand new.

287
14:28.759 --> 14:30.280
Get Mingkun to teach you.

288
14:30.360 --> 14:31.760
I'm not cut out to be your teacher.

289
14:36.039 --> 14:37.159
I only want you to teach me.

290
14:38.440 --> 14:39.920
You have a perfectly good car.

291
14:40.000 --> 14:41.400
Why do you even want to learn this?

292
14:43.519 --> 14:44.840
I want to

293
14:46.639 --> 14:48.080
get closer to your world.

294
15:07.320 --> 15:08.600
What are you standing there for?

295
15:11.200 --> 15:12.200
Let's go.

296
15:44.480 --> 15:45.480
Be careful.

297
15:48.480 --> 15:49.535
Watch where you're going! Are you blind?

298
15:49.559 --> 15:49.920
I'm sorry!

299
15:50.000 --> 15:51.120
Some people have no manners.

300
16:01.879 --> 16:02.919
Nice job!

301
16:30.799 --> 16:32.079
Why are you sitting so far away?

302
16:32.720 --> 16:34.000
Just trying not to overheat you.

303
16:34.759 --> 16:36.440
It's too hot to sit that close.

304
16:37.960 --> 16:39.199
Come here.

305
16:39.279 --> 16:40.600
I like having you close to me.

306
17:08.519 --> 17:09.775
Why did you only buy one bottle?

307
17:09.799 --> 17:10.799
Aren't you thirsty?

308
17:11.519 --> 17:12.519
I'm not.

309
17:16.480 --> 17:17.559
Oh, I get it.

310
17:19.599 --> 17:22.680
You wanted us to share the same bottle, didn't you?

311
17:23.839 --> 17:25.440
Too bad I drank it all. Now what?

312
17:26.599 --> 17:27.639
I'll just buy another one.

313
17:30.519 --> 17:31.640
Stop wasting money.

314
17:32.480 --> 17:34.200
I'll just drink some water when I get home.

315
17:35.079 --> 17:36.679
Did you need anything else?

316
17:36.759 --> 17:38.799
If not, I'm heading back.

317
17:41.799 --> 17:42.880
Wait, come back.

318
17:42.960 --> 17:43.960
There is something.

319
17:51.599 --> 17:52.880
What is it?

320
17:54.640 --> 17:55.640
I...

321
18:00.319 --> 18:01.400
I wanted to ask you,

322
18:02.119 --> 18:03.359
do you have any hobbies?

323
18:05.720 --> 18:06.880
Not really.

324
18:06.960 --> 18:07.960
None at all?

325
18:09.799 --> 18:11.240
Doesn't everyone have a hobby?

326
18:12.160 --> 18:13.439
Take you, for example.

327
18:13.519 --> 18:14.679
Cooking is your hobby, right?

328
18:15.480 --> 18:18.679
Cooking is just how I survive.

329
18:18.759 --> 18:20.039
It doesn't count as a hobby.

330
18:21.200 --> 18:22.856
I'll teach you how to skateboard next time.

331
18:22.880 --> 18:23.976
I might suck at riding a scooter,

332
18:24.000 --> 18:25.359
but I'm amazing on a skateboard.

333
18:27.680 --> 18:29.360
You need to pick up some hobbies.

334
18:29.440 --> 18:31.160
Life's way too boring without them.

335
18:34.440 --> 18:36.439
Poor people don't have the energy

336
18:36.519 --> 18:38.920
to waste on useless hobbies.

337
18:41.720 --> 18:44.359
Just scraping by is hard enough.

338
18:47.039 --> 18:49.720
That's why you should just be with me.

339
18:53.279 --> 18:54.519
Hear me out first.

340
18:55.680 --> 18:57.519
Even if I do end up with you,

341
18:57.599 --> 18:59.439
it'll be because I like you,

342
18:59.519 --> 19:00.559
not because of your money.

343
19:01.880 --> 19:03.279
Then...

344
19:03.359 --> 19:05.759
when you said we were just in it for the physical pleasure,

345
19:05.839 --> 19:06.839
did you mean it?

346
19:08.480 --> 19:12.376
I only said that because you're always flying off the handle for no reason.

347
19:12.400 --> 19:15.012
I wasn't flying off the handle! I just panicked, that's all.

348
19:15.079 --> 19:15.999
Then can you promise me

349
19:16.079 --> 19:17.439
you'll stop acting like that?

350
19:17.519 --> 19:19.920
Stop losing your temper out of nowhere

351
19:20.480 --> 19:21.719
and resorting to violence.

352
19:21.799 --> 19:23.015
Can we just talk things through like normal people?

353
19:23.039 --> 19:23.840
Hold on.

354
19:23.920 --> 19:25.616
Doesn't your friend lose his temper all the time?

355
19:25.640 --> 19:26.656
Why don't you lecture him?

356
19:26.680 --> 19:27.279
He even punched me!

357
19:27.359 --> 19:28.959
That's totally different.

358
19:29.039 --> 19:30.239
He was acting in self-defense.

359
19:30.279 --> 19:31.039
He was just having my back.

360
19:31.119 --> 19:32.216
You, on the other hand, are completely unreasonable.

361
19:32.240 --> 19:33.320
You lash out at everything.

362
19:34.160 --> 19:35.279
If you keep doing that,

363
19:35.359 --> 19:36.519
it's honestly going to make

364
19:36.599 --> 19:37.719
being around you exhausting.

365
19:53.759 --> 19:54.759
Have a seat.

366
19:56.759 --> 19:58.039
That's alright, Master P'Aya.

367
19:58.680 --> 20:00.376
I still have matters to attend to for Master P'Eng.

368
20:00.400 --> 20:01.759
I'm fine standing.

369
20:03.079 --> 20:04.439
Is P'Eng not back yet?

370
20:04.519 --> 20:05.279
No, sir.

371
20:05.359 --> 20:07.119
Master P'Eng will likely be late.

372
20:07.799 --> 20:09.440
Still with that boy, is he?

373
20:10.960 --> 20:11.960
Yes.

374
20:15.279 --> 20:16.400
This thing between them...

375
20:16.480 --> 20:17.480
What do you make of it?

376
20:18.759 --> 20:21.320
It's not my place to interfere in the Young Master's affairs.

377
20:21.400 --> 20:22.680
I simply follow orders.

378
20:23.240 --> 20:24.400
Come now.

379
20:25.559 --> 20:27.759
You know how P'Eng is.

380
20:28.440 --> 20:30.079
He's brilliant at everything he does,

381
20:30.720 --> 20:32.440
until feelings get involved.

382
20:33.079 --> 20:35.039
The moment he catches feelings,

383
20:35.119 --> 20:36.519
he throws all caution to the wind.

384
20:38.359 --> 20:41.039
It's not that I'm against them being together.

385
20:41.119 --> 20:43.360
It's just that you know P'Eng's nature.

386
20:43.440 --> 20:44.679
He's terribly stubborn.

387
20:44.759 --> 20:46.959
When he's obsessed with a new toy, no one can touch it.

388
20:47.839 --> 20:49.319
But the second he loses interest,

389
20:50.279 --> 20:52.119
he tosses them aside without a second thought.

390
20:53.000 --> 20:54.080
He can be utterly ruthless.

391
20:54.839 --> 20:55.960
Don't you agree?

392
21:01.559 --> 21:04.160
That boy seems quite innocent and kind-hearted.

393
21:04.240 --> 21:06.559
We shouldn't let an innocent kid get hurt.

394
21:07.559 --> 21:08.559
So,

395
21:09.559 --> 21:12.999
find an opportunity to end things between them.

396
21:13.079 --> 21:17.160
It's for the best... for him, and for the company.

397
21:18.160 --> 21:19.240
What do you think?

398
21:22.880 --> 21:24.920
How would you like me to handle it?

399
21:30.279 --> 21:31.359
First of all,

400
21:31.960 --> 21:34.439
hear people out and understand what they want

401
21:34.519 --> 21:36.200
before you decide how to react.

402
21:36.720 --> 21:38.759
Don't immediately get so defensive.

403
21:38.839 --> 21:40.039
Try being a little gentler.

404
21:41.119 --> 21:42.119
Gentle?

405
21:44.720 --> 21:47.279
The word "gentle" isn't even in my vocabulary.

406
21:50.880 --> 21:51.880
Yes, it is.

407
21:52.400 --> 21:54.320
I've seen the way you treat Xiaotong and Xiaoya.

408
21:55.759 --> 21:56.759
Really?

409
21:57.960 --> 21:59.000
That counts as gentle?

410
21:59.720 --> 22:00.800
Yeah.

411
22:00.880 --> 22:02.759
That's exactly what being gentle feels like.

412
22:03.720 --> 22:04.640
Tell you what,

413
22:04.720 --> 22:05.896
why not try treating everyone else

414
22:05.920 --> 22:07.640
like they're kids, too?

415
22:07.720 --> 22:08.959
Give it a shot.

416
22:09.039 --> 22:10.039
It just might work.

417
22:13.480 --> 22:14.480
Alright.

418
22:15.359 --> 22:16.359
I promise you.

419
22:16.920 --> 22:18.320
I'll do my best to be

420
22:18.400 --> 22:19.400
a gentler person.

421
22:31.799 --> 22:33.279
Wait, you haven't had dinner yet?

422
22:35.160 --> 22:37.559
I was so busy looking for you, I completely forgot to eat.

423
22:46.720 --> 22:48.200
So, this scooter...

424
22:48.759 --> 22:50.039
is mine now, right?

425
22:50.799 --> 22:51.799
Yep.

426
23:00.799 --> 23:01.799
This scooter

427
23:02.839 --> 23:03.960
belongs to you now.

428
23:07.240 --> 23:09.400
We don't have anything fancy at my place,

429
23:09.480 --> 23:11.759
but if you come back with me, I can whip up something

430
23:13.000 --> 23:14.319
to tide you over.

431
23:21.759 --> 23:23.839
So when you say you "follow orders,"

432
23:24.599 --> 23:26.519
you only mean P'Eng's orders.

433
23:27.200 --> 23:28.320
Is that it?

434
23:28.400 --> 23:29.400
I wouldn't dare.

435
23:30.240 --> 23:33.360
I just feel this matter is far too personal.

436
23:33.440 --> 23:35.640
It's best to let Master P'Eng handle it himself.

437
23:35.720 --> 23:37.479
Besides, I'm not clever enough

438
23:37.559 --> 23:38.640
to come up with a good way

439
23:38.720 --> 23:39.920
to break them up quickly.

440
23:43.240 --> 23:45.440
You grew up with P'Eng.

441
23:46.000 --> 23:47.719
You must know him inside and out.

442
23:47.799 --> 23:49.360
Given your age

443
23:49.440 --> 23:50.440
and experience,

444
23:51.039 --> 23:53.720
there's no way you can't figure out how to end this.

445
24:04.480 --> 24:05.480
By the way,

446
24:06.359 --> 24:08.159
your parents are over in Norway, aren't they?

447
24:08.640 --> 24:09.799
I trust they're doing well?

448
24:10.839 --> 24:11.920
Thanks to you,

449
24:12.000 --> 24:13.000
they are doing very well.

450
24:14.440 --> 24:16.839
I really envy them for having such a devoted son.

451
24:18.559 --> 24:21.279
Father sent them to the mines in Norway.

452
24:22.039 --> 24:23.559
That must have been years ago.

453
24:24.680 --> 24:26.240
You must miss them terribly.

454
24:28.920 --> 24:30.119
If you miss them that much,

455
24:30.839 --> 24:32.440
I can always send you to Norway, too.

456
24:33.839 --> 24:35.239
You're all grown up now, after all.

457
24:36.119 --> 24:37.839
It's time you fulfilled your duty as a son.

458
24:38.599 --> 24:40.239
It's the least our family can do for you.

459
24:47.480 --> 24:49.079
You catch my drift, don't you?

460
24:49.799 --> 24:50.799
Yes.

461
24:51.359 --> 24:53.479
I grew up right alongside Master P'Eng.

462
24:53.559 --> 24:54.896
Even though he's the young master,

463
24:54.920 --> 24:56.160
in my eyes,

464
24:56.240 --> 24:57.960
he's no different from family.

465
24:58.799 --> 25:00.400
I once promised the late master

466
25:00.480 --> 25:03.080
that I would take good care of this family and the young masters.

467
25:03.759 --> 25:05.400
However, I also believe

468
25:05.480 --> 25:06.800
that even without me,

469
25:06.880 --> 25:08.759
you both will do just fine.

470
25:35.480 --> 25:36.680
All we have left is noodles.

471
25:37.519 --> 25:38.800
It'll have to do for now.

472
25:38.880 --> 25:39.880
Works for me.

473
25:42.119 --> 25:43.400
Pao Bei!

474
25:43.480 --> 25:44.360
You're back!

475
25:44.440 --> 25:45.679
And P'Eng is here, too!

476
25:45.759 --> 25:46.160
Hey.

477
25:46.240 --> 25:47.039
Xiaotong, Xiaoya.

478
25:47.119 --> 25:48.199
Come give me a hug.

479
25:48.279 --> 25:49.279
Come here.

480
26:01.079 --> 26:02.919
What's the big secret I'm not allowed to hear?

481
26:05.720 --> 26:06.199
Go on.

482
26:06.279 --> 26:07.279
Okay.

483
26:08.039 --> 26:09.039
Let's go.

484
26:12.599 --> 26:13.239
What are you up to?

485
26:13.319 --> 26:14.439
Why so secretive?

486
26:14.519 --> 26:16.239
Finish eating first,

487
26:16.319 --> 26:17.696
then let's go out for some fresh air.

488
26:17.720 --> 26:18.640
You'll find out soon enough.

489
26:18.720 --> 26:19.720
Stop asking.

490
26:34.920 --> 26:36.199
Seriously though,

491
26:36.279 --> 26:37.799
you guys should all move in with me.

492
26:38.759 --> 26:40.279
That way, I can take good care of you.

493
26:45.000 --> 26:47.240
I still prefer sitting right here, looking at the stars.

494
26:48.880 --> 26:49.960
The stars?

495
26:52.480 --> 26:53.480
Can't you see the stars

496
26:53.559 --> 26:54.559
from my place, too?

497
26:56.160 --> 26:57.319
It's not the same.

498
26:59.359 --> 27:01.079
Have you ever heard that lyric,

499
27:01.720 --> 27:03.759
"Stars are a poor man's pearls"?

500
27:04.680 --> 27:05.680
Never heard of it.

501
27:05.720 --> 27:06.720
What song is that from?

502
27:07.240 --> 27:09.039
It's a song I really love

503
27:09.119 --> 27:11.279
called "Silk Road."

504
27:11.880 --> 27:13.480
When the lyrics say

505
27:14.359 --> 27:16.680
"stars are a poor man's pearls,"

506
27:17.200 --> 27:21.160
I guess this is the exact feeling it means.

507
27:26.039 --> 27:27.479
I can give you way more

508
27:27.559 --> 27:28.999
than just pearls.

509
27:29.079 --> 27:30.479
Anything you like,

510
27:30.559 --> 27:31.559
anything you want.

511
27:32.359 --> 27:35.359
Don't you want a better life than this?

512
27:37.759 --> 27:39.480
I want that more than anyone.

513
27:40.400 --> 27:41.559
But I feel like.

514
27:42.519 --> 27:44.440
I need time to adjust.

515
27:46.480 --> 27:47.720
If things change too fast,

516
27:48.480 --> 27:49.959
it'll feel like I'm abandoning

517
27:50.039 --> 27:51.400
who I used to be.

518
27:56.119 --> 27:57.119
Forget it.

519
27:57.160 --> 27:58.519
I'm just being weird.

520
27:59.079 --> 28:00.639
I don't blame you for feeling that way.

521
28:09.480 --> 28:10.960
I'm realizing.

522
28:12.599 --> 28:16.160
I've never truly stepped into your world.

523
28:19.960 --> 28:21.279
A lot of what you said today

524
28:21.359 --> 28:22.440
really surprised me.

525
28:23.079 --> 28:24.720
I used to just see you as a kid.

526
28:26.359 --> 28:27.440
I had no idea

527
28:28.720 --> 28:31.200
you were so mature for your age.

528
28:34.920 --> 28:36.640
When it comes to emotions,

529
28:37.200 --> 28:39.519
I feel like you could be my teacher.

530
28:41.680 --> 28:42.920
You're just realizing that now?

531
28:43.599 --> 28:44.599
Well then,

532
28:45.279 --> 28:46.839
how about I be your relationship coach,

533
28:47.720 --> 28:49.240
and you teach me how to make money?

534
28:50.400 --> 28:51.600
Or better yet,

535
28:51.680 --> 28:53.519
I could come work at Yingyu Group.

536
28:55.240 --> 28:57.759
I want to be able to help you out, too.

537
29:02.079 --> 29:04.200
Don't ever hold yourself back for me.

538
29:06.200 --> 29:07.719
You just keep moving forward,

539
29:07.799 --> 29:08.880
and as for me,

540
29:10.119 --> 29:12.440
I'll work hard to catch up to you.

541
29:20.279 --> 29:21.799
Pao Bei, we're done!

542
29:22.759 --> 29:24.080
Go ahead and bring it out.

543
29:24.160 --> 29:26.080
Close your eyes!

544
29:26.160 --> 29:27.400
Close my eyes?

545
29:29.480 --> 29:31.000
He's definitely your brother, Pao Bei.

546
29:31.599 --> 29:32.599
Here!

547
29:36.119 --> 29:37.200
You can open your eyes now!

548
29:48.720 --> 29:49.720
Who's all

549
29:50.839 --> 29:51.839
on here?

550
29:52.359 --> 29:53.560
It's the four of us,

551
29:53.640 --> 29:54.320
plus A Pong,

552
29:54.400 --> 29:55.679
and Milan!

553
29:55.759 --> 29:56.679
P'Eng,

554
29:56.759 --> 29:58.759
do you like our present?

555
29:59.680 --> 30:00.680
I love it.

556
30:01.799 --> 30:03.559
This is the best gift I've ever received.

557
30:04.079 --> 30:05.400
Thank you, Xiaotong and Xiaoya.

558
30:05.480 --> 30:07.959
P'Eng traded that brand-new

559
30:08.039 --> 30:09.880
scooter for this.

560
30:09.960 --> 30:12.039
A whole scooter for one helmet...

561
30:12.119 --> 30:13.119
Don't you think

562
30:13.680 --> 30:15.119
you got the short end of the stick?

563
30:32.519 --> 30:34.239
Go on a date with me this weekend.

564
30:34.319 --> 30:35.519
Dress up nicely.

565
30:53.720 --> 30:54.720
This painting...

566
30:55.319 --> 30:57.279
I only remember there being a gorilla in it.

567
30:58.319 --> 30:59.880
Why are there bloodstains?

568
31:00.839 --> 31:03.800
And this grid...

569
31:03.880 --> 31:07.079
What do the butterfly and "HELP" mean?

570
31:13.119 --> 31:14.199
Mingkun,

571
31:14.279 --> 31:15.856
I need you to help me research something.

572
31:15.880 --> 31:17.480
Come find me as soon as you wake up tomorrow morning.

573
31:29.559 --> 31:32.640
He actually made a little outfit for it.

574
32:13.720 --> 32:15.360
Why are you pulling out all your clothes?

575
32:15.960 --> 32:19.279
Did you finally wise up and decide to move into the big mansion?

576
32:19.359 --> 32:20.120
A Pong.

577
32:20.200 --> 32:21.279
Yeah?

578
32:21.359 --> 32:23.360
Do you have any nice clothes I can borrow?

579
32:23.440 --> 32:25.080
Nice clothes?

580
32:25.160 --> 32:26.880
Aren't all my clothes nice?

581
32:27.400 --> 32:28.400
What's the occasion?

582
32:30.720 --> 32:31.960
Not the stuff you usually wear.

583
32:32.880 --> 32:34.160
I need something

584
32:35.039 --> 32:36.600
to wear on a date.

585
32:36.680 --> 32:37.680
What did you just say?

586
32:38.400 --> 32:39.680
I don't think I heard you right.

587
32:40.559 --> 32:43.680
I said, a date.

588
32:47.440 --> 32:49.599
You're going on a date with the Big Bad Wolf?

589
32:51.200 --> 32:53.319
Okay, you definitely need something decent for that.

590
32:57.640 --> 32:59.279
But honestly,

591
32:59.359 --> 33:01.759
do I look like I own anything that nice?

592
33:11.880 --> 33:13.840
You're looking for something really sharp, right?

593
33:14.119 --> 33:16.039
I know just the place to hook you up.

594
33:16.640 --> 33:17.400
Come with me.

595
33:17.480 --> 33:19.600
I guarantee a total makeover.

596
33:19.680 --> 33:20.999
Let's go.

597
33:21.079 --> 33:21.600
Come on.

598
33:21.680 --> 33:22.680
Hurry!

599
33:30.680 --> 33:33.000
You can't go out dressed like that.

600
33:34.039 --> 33:35.599
Why not?

601
33:36.400 --> 33:37.640
Huh?

602
33:37.720 --> 33:38.720
He looks super handsome.

603
33:40.799 --> 33:43.239
I think it's a bit over the top, too.

604
33:43.319 --> 33:44.359
Maybe it doesn't suit me.

605
33:45.000 --> 33:46.840
How does it not suit you?

606
33:46.920 --> 33:48.360
You're just not used to it.

607
33:48.440 --> 33:49.279
If you go out like this,

608
33:49.359 --> 33:51.376
people will definitely mistake you for a celebrity.

609
33:51.400 --> 33:52.680
Look how good you look, Pao Bei.

610
33:53.720 --> 33:54.999
Tell me,

611
33:55.079 --> 33:56.240
what's wrong with it?

612
33:58.279 --> 34:00.279
With you looking this sharp,

613
34:00.359 --> 34:03.519
I'm afraid the Big Bad Boss won't even be in the mood to go out,

614
34:03.599 --> 34:05.399
and will just want to drag you straight home.

615
34:06.319 --> 34:07.439
A Pong,

616
34:07.519 --> 34:09.320
is this outfit really okay?

617
34:09.880 --> 34:12.175
Hey, I'm known as one of the best-dressed celebrities out there.

618
34:12.199 --> 34:13.079
Besides,

619
34:13.159 --> 34:15.880
this is the exact outfit I wore to my very first fan meet.

620
34:15.960 --> 34:16.976
It's really meaningful.

621
34:17.000 --> 34:18.760
It'll definitely bring you good luck.

622
34:18.840 --> 34:19.840
Mm-hmm.

623
34:22.719 --> 34:24.079
It's your first date, after all.

624
34:24.159 --> 34:26.280
You definitely want to blow Boss P'Eng away,

625
34:26.800 --> 34:27.800
right?

626
34:29.079 --> 34:31.200
I'm not questioning your taste.

627
34:31.280 --> 34:33.519
It's just, like you said,

628
34:33.599 --> 34:35.159
I'm probably just not used to it yet.

629
34:36.159 --> 34:38.240
Then take it for a spin outside.

630
34:38.320 --> 34:39.999
You'll get used to it in no time.

631
34:40.079 --> 34:40.959
You look great,

632
34:41.039 --> 34:42.280
and it really suits you.

633
34:42.360 --> 34:43.880
You're definitely going to turn heads.

634
34:43.960 --> 34:45.999
Take a walk outside and see for yourself.

635
34:46.079 --> 34:46.800
Yeah!

636
34:46.880 --> 34:47.760
Go take a walk,

637
34:47.840 --> 34:49.120
and stun everyone on the street.

638
34:50.440 --> 34:51.440
Go on.

639
34:53.639 --> 34:54.920
Go on, you got this.

640
34:57.800 --> 34:58.800
Wait here.

641
34:58.880 --> 35:00.720
I'll sneak after him and see how it goes.

642
35:00.800 --> 35:01.800
Okay.

643
35:05.119 --> 35:08.159
Who knew nice clothes could be so uncomfortable?

644
35:09.000 --> 35:11.119
My own clothes are way more comfortable.

645
35:12.519 --> 35:14.999
This makeup feels heavy on my skin, too.

646
35:15.079 --> 35:17.039
Being a celebrity really isn't an easy gig.

647
35:20.159 --> 35:21.159
Look, is that him?

648
35:22.039 --> 35:22.800
He looks just like him!

649
35:22.880 --> 35:23.920
Don't you think so?

650
35:24.519 --> 35:25.519
Hold up!

651
35:25.599 --> 35:25.959
Wait a second!

652
35:26.039 --> 35:27.039
Hi there!

653
35:27.679 --> 35:28.159
Wait up!

654
35:28.239 --> 35:28.680
Excuse me,

655
35:28.760 --> 35:29.840
are you an artist?

656
35:31.760 --> 35:32.439
No, I'm not.

657
35:32.519 --> 35:33.400
Are you sure?

658
35:33.480 --> 35:35.760
We thought you were this celebrity we really love,

659
35:35.840 --> 35:37.055
because that outfit you're wearing

660
35:37.079 --> 35:38.296
is the exact same one he wore at his fan meet.

661
35:38.320 --> 35:39.079
Could we get a picture with you?

662
35:39.159 --> 35:40.159
Just one photo together?

663
35:42.239 --> 35:43.479
I'm really not him.

664
35:43.559 --> 35:44.479
That's fine!

665
35:44.559 --> 35:45.559
Let's just take one

666
35:45.599 --> 35:47.015
to send to our other fan club friends.

667
35:47.039 --> 35:47.200
Yeah!

668
35:47.280 --> 35:48.495
They'll totally buy that it's him.

669
35:48.519 --> 35:49.559
Come on.

670
35:49.639 --> 35:50.240
It's fine.

671
35:50.320 --> 35:51.039
Let's just snap a quick pic.

672
35:51.119 --> 35:52.119
Right here.

673
35:52.199 --> 35:53.359
The background is great here.

674
35:54.840 --> 35:55.559
Come on.

675
35:55.639 --> 35:57.239
Look here.

676
35:58.719 --> 35:58.999
Great.

677
35:59.079 --> 36:00.279
Can you throw up a peace sign?

678
36:01.400 --> 36:03.000
Yes, just like that! So handsome!

679
36:05.199 --> 36:06.240
Thank you so much!

680
36:06.320 --> 36:07.360
Look what you've done.

681
36:07.440 --> 36:08.200
Thanks!

682
36:08.280 --> 36:09.159
What am I supposed to do now?

683
36:09.239 --> 36:10.760
Thank you!

684
36:10.840 --> 36:11.400
You look amazing!

685
36:11.480 --> 36:11.920
Thanks!

686
36:12.000 --> 36:13.119
Bye!

687
36:21.760 --> 36:22.559
What are you doing?

688
36:22.639 --> 36:23.680
Who are you?

689
36:23.760 --> 36:24.760
Let go of me!

690
36:27.280 --> 36:28.720
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

691
36:28.960 --> 36:30.200
Stop! What are you doing?

692
36:30.280 --> 36:31.440
Get out of the car right now!

693
36:33.480 --> 36:34.800
This is bad!

694
36:34.880 --> 36:35.680
Something terrible happened!

695
36:35.760 --> 36:37.200
Pao Bei just got kidnapped!

696
36:37.280 --> 36:38.280
Kidnapped?

697
36:39.519 --> 36:40.519
What happened?

698
36:40.599 --> 36:41.599
I'm not sure.

699
36:41.639 --> 36:43.639
A van just pulled up out of nowhere,

700
36:43.719 --> 36:45.680
and two big guys jumped out,

701
36:45.760 --> 36:46.680
wearing red,

702
36:46.760 --> 36:48.400
and they just dragged Pao Bei away!

703
36:48.480 --> 36:49.760
The license plate?

704
36:49.840 --> 36:50.639
The license plate...

705
36:50.719 --> 36:52.360
KQ 7391.

706
36:52.920 --> 36:53.920
Track it down, now!

707
36:54.000 --> 36:55.360
Got it, I'm on it.

708
36:55.440 --> 36:56.440
Wait.

709
36:57.239 --> 36:58.359
Is my brother still at home?

710
36:59.079 --> 37:00.119
He should be in the study.

711
37:00.880 --> 37:01.880
Not again.

712
37:02.599 --> 37:04.039
The exact same trick.

713
37:04.760 --> 37:05.639
I'm going to confront P'Aya.

714
37:05.719 --> 37:06.400
If he won't admit it,

715
37:06.480 --> 37:07.480
call the police.

716
37:20.199 --> 37:22.479
Don't you knock anymore, little brother?

717
37:22.559 --> 37:23.639
Did you do this?

718
37:28.519 --> 37:29.519
Do what?

719
37:29.559 --> 37:31.095
Did you pull the same dirty trick as back then

720
37:31.119 --> 37:32.119
and have him kidnapped?

721
37:33.519 --> 37:34.519
Kidnapped?

722
37:35.599 --> 37:36.320
Who?

723
37:36.400 --> 37:38.079
Stop playing dumb! Who else?

724
37:38.159 --> 37:39.655
The boy you've been trying to drive away!

725
37:39.679 --> 37:40.679
He was just kidnapped.

726
37:42.440 --> 37:44.039
I really didn't do it.

727
37:44.840 --> 37:46.256
Why are you falsely accusing me again,

728
37:46.280 --> 37:46.880
little brother?

729
37:46.960 --> 37:48.896
Just a few days ago, you were forcing me to break up with him.

730
37:48.920 --> 37:50.215
Is this because I didn't do as you said?

731
37:50.239 --> 37:51.559
Is that why you resorted to this?

732
37:53.000 --> 37:54.280
You say I did it.

733
37:54.920 --> 37:56.079
Do you have any proof?

734
37:56.159 --> 37:57.240
Cut the crap!

735
37:57.320 --> 37:58.400
Hand him over right now,

736
37:58.480 --> 37:59.360
or I'm calling the cops.

737
37:59.440 --> 38:01.400
Don't blame me when I forget we're brothers.

738
38:01.480 --> 38:02.760
Fine.

739
38:02.840 --> 38:04.200
Call them.

740
38:04.280 --> 38:05.639
Or,

741
38:05.719 --> 38:07.880
you could let your big brother help you look for him.

742
38:09.039 --> 38:11.200
The police have enough on their plate.

743
38:11.280 --> 38:12.760
No need to bother them.

744
38:12.840 --> 38:14.719
Still playing games with me, huh?

745
38:17.800 --> 38:18.999
Oh, come on.

746
38:19.079 --> 38:20.320
My dear little brother,

747
38:20.400 --> 38:21.720
you're great in every way,

748
38:21.800 --> 38:23.240
except for that hot temper of yours.

749
38:24.840 --> 38:26.519
What's the license plate number?

750
38:26.599 --> 38:28.400
I'll have Tina look into it for you.

751
38:28.480 --> 38:29.400
Save it.

752
38:29.480 --> 38:30.480
I'll find him myself.

753
38:33.159 --> 38:34.799
You'd better pray you're not behind this.

754
38:35.559 --> 38:37.320
Because if I find out you are,

755
38:37.880 --> 38:39.320
I will never let you off the hook.

756
38:44.440 --> 38:46.880
Don't even think about controlling me anymore.

757
38:47.840 --> 38:48.960
I refuse to lose anyone else

758
38:49.599 --> 38:50.880
because of you.

759
39:03.920 --> 39:04.920
Eat up!

760
39:06.280 --> 39:06.999
Come on,

761
39:07.079 --> 39:07.559
let's drink.

762
39:07.639 --> 39:08.280
Here,

763
39:08.360 --> 39:08.840
drink up.

764
39:08.920 --> 39:09.439
Cheers!

765
39:09.519 --> 39:09.760
Bottoms up!

766
39:09.840 --> 39:10.840
Cheers!

767
39:11.840 --> 39:13.119
Where am I?

768
39:13.199 --> 39:14.199
Who are these people?

769
39:15.079 --> 39:16.519
Why did they bring me here?

770
39:17.119 --> 39:18.119
Boys,

771
39:18.159 --> 39:19.920
we're finally back in business!

772
39:20.000 --> 39:21.639
Once the boss gets here

773
39:21.719 --> 39:22.920
and takes him off our hands,

774
39:23.000 --> 39:25.079
we're gonna make a killing!

775
39:26.440 --> 39:27.559
Drink up!

776
39:27.639 --> 39:27.840
Drink!

777
39:27.920 --> 39:28.920
Come on!

778
39:30.239 --> 39:32.599
Talk about a crazy coincidence.

779
39:32.679 --> 39:34.800
That mansion is a real goldmine for us.

780
39:35.400 --> 39:37.680
What was the name of the one we grabbed last time?

781
39:37.760 --> 39:39.080
That maid with the last name Pao.

782
39:39.320 --> 39:40.880
She worked for that family, too.

783
39:41.480 --> 39:43.960
And this job is tied to the exact same house.

784
39:44.679 --> 39:45.920
They mean my mom.

785
39:46.519 --> 39:47.920
My mom was kidnapped, too!

786
39:48.880 --> 39:50.175
Who is this "boss" they're talking about?

787
39:50.199 --> 39:53.079
Seriously, this boss is a real weirdo.

788
39:53.159 --> 39:54.159
Filthy rich,

789
39:54.239 --> 39:56.320
yet dead set on going after his own gardener.

790
39:56.400 --> 39:58.159
Who knows what's going through his head?

791
39:58.239 --> 39:59.320
His own...

792
40:00.199 --> 40:01.960
If the boss is from the house...

793
40:02.480 --> 40:03.679
Could it be P'Eng?

794
40:05.199 --> 40:05.999
No,

795
40:06.079 --> 40:07.079
impossible.

796
40:11.440 --> 40:12.840
Boys,

797
40:12.920 --> 40:14.360
we've got another job!

798
40:18.119 --> 40:21.119
Man, if only we'd grabbed a female celebrity,

799
40:21.199 --> 40:22.320
that would've been great.

800
40:22.400 --> 40:23.800
Then we

801
40:24.320 --> 40:26.119
could've had some real fun.

802
40:27.559 --> 40:28.559
What a pity.

803
40:29.199 --> 40:30.400
It's a male celebrity.

804
40:31.239 --> 40:32.519
How boring.

805
40:35.639 --> 40:37.240
Look at this kid.

806
40:37.320 --> 40:38.679
Smooth, delicate skin.

807
40:39.880 --> 40:41.119
Having some fun with him

808
40:41.760 --> 40:43.480
would definitely be interesting too.

809
40:45.840 --> 40:48.800
Have you guys never messed with a guy before?

810
40:50.920 --> 40:52.079
Once you get into it,

811
40:52.159 --> 40:54.280
it's a whole different kind of thrill.

812
40:57.119 --> 40:57.840
Drink up.

813
40:57.920 --> 40:58.159
Come on.

814
40:58.679 --> 41:00.159
Now that I'm full and satisfied,

815
41:01.000 --> 41:03.559
I have the energy to get to work.

816
41:05.639 --> 41:06.639
Go on.

817
41:07.199 --> 41:10.200
Strip all the clothes off this kid for me.

818
41:10.280 --> 41:11.519
Take some photos

819
41:11.599 --> 41:12.719
and shoot some videos.

820
41:13.679 --> 41:14.679
You got it, boss.

821
41:17.760 --> 41:18.200
Strip him down.

822
41:18.280 --> 41:19.280
Come here.

823
41:20.039 --> 41:20.880
Don't move.

824
41:20.960 --> 41:22.000
Strip everything off him!

825
41:22.559 --> 41:23.119
Wait.

826
41:23.199 --> 41:23.760
Boss,

827
41:23.840 --> 41:25.400
it looks like he has something to say.

828
41:25.480 --> 41:27.079
Why listen to his nonsense?

829
41:27.159 --> 41:30.039
We just need to do as the boss ordered.

830
41:30.119 --> 41:31.119
Strip him.
